BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:$15 Moonshine Flights & Moonshine Tasting
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250615
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250616
DTSTAMP:20261030T164859Z
UID:b6432d870f2c0958f26453a40d59@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Try a Moonshine Flight tasting at Moonshine Alley! Moonshine F
 lights are available daily for just $15! We have over 13 flavors to choose
  from\, so pick your four favorite four and get sippin'! This is the perfe
 ct thing to do in Providence if you like good moonshine\, good food\, and 
 good music!\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/%2415-moonsh
 ine-flights-%26-moonshine-tasting/105663/
LOCATION:Moonshine Alley\, 52 Pine Street\, Providence\, RI 02903
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/%2415-moonshine-flights-%26-moo
 nshine-tasting/105663/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Coastal Cruisers - The Golden Hour
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260502
DTSTAMP:20261030T164859Z
UID:9f3864060ce7679e35293700f37c@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Island in our Coastal Cruisers\, Newport’s pr
 ivate chauffeured luxury tour\, dedicated to providing a sophisticated way
  to experience our beloved island. We blend elegance\, fun &amp\; storytel
 ling into a bespoke tour of Newport. For us\, it is about fostering experi
 ences that create lasting memorable moments. From chasing golden sunsets t
 o experiencing salty-breeze adventures\, Coastal Cruisers treats every tou
 r as an opportunity to provide exceptional service &amp\; a personal conne
 ction that lasts well beyond the journey. Offer 3 tour options and hourly 
 bookings. Tour Option: The Golden Hour A private\, bespoke guided excursio
 n designed to highlight Newport's most magnificent sunset vistas. This dis
 tinctive experience is meticulously orchestrated\, ensuring optimal positi
 oning at prime viewing locations for capturing striking photographs &amp\;
  securing a truly memorable occasion. Your experienced guide will navigate
  picturesque coastal thoroughfares and Newport's charming bridge view neig
 hborhoods\, making stops at both lesser-known vantage points &amp\; renown
 ed landmarks celebrated for their exceptional 'golden hour' illumination &
 amp\; sweeping ocean panoramas. 7:00 PM Tour (75 minutes) $150 per person 
 Available: Daily\, May 1 - December 31\, 2026 (Unavailable May 23 and May 
 31)\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/coastal-cruisers-the
 -golden-hour/109827/
LOCATION:Coastal Cruisers\, 478 Thames Street\, Newport\, RI 02840
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/coastal-cruisers-the-golden-hou
 r/109827/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
