DTSTAMP:20261030T164859Z
UID:37187c00b6638c67228262f37611@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Blue Drew and the Magoos present a Grateful P-Funk Halloween P
 arty at Duffins Pub in Pawtucket\, RI! The night before Halloween\, hear a
  blend of Grateful Dead and Parliament-Funkadelic music\, played live by B
 lue Drew and the Magoos! Music at 9pm No cover charge Cash only bar 21+\n
 \nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/a-grateful-p-funk-hallowe
 en-party-with-blue-drew-%26-the-magoos-at-duffins-pub/112390/
LOCATION:Duffins Pub\, 215 Division St.\, Pawtucket\, 02861 Time: 9:00 PM 
 to 12:30 AM
