BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A New England Thanksgiving
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261030
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTSTAMP:20261030T164859Z
UID:23705f138b782124fe1cc6960efa@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Join the Coggeshall staff as we prepare a Thanksgiving meal ov
 er the hearth in our historic farmhouse. The late 18th century was before 
 the official start of Thanksgiving as a national holiday\, but the day was
  still celebrated with food and prayer in New England. Watch our costumed 
 historians make chicken on a string\, bake a pie in the hot coals\, mash t
 urnips and churn butter. In the woodshop we will also demonstrate carving 
 wooden spoons. Explore the garden to see the last of the fall harvest. Wal
 k the nature trail and look for signs of wild turkey\, see musket demonstr
 ations and try your aim with rubber band targets. Please note: This is not
  a Thanksgiving meal for visitors to eat. Food prepared in the historic Fa
 rmhouse Kitchen does not meet modern health and food preparation codes for
  public consumption.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/a-n
 ew-england-thanksgiving/112116/
LOCATION:Coggeshall Farm Museum\, 1 Colt Drive\, Bristol\, 02809 Time: 10:
 00 AM to 4:00 PM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/a-new-england-thanksgiving/1121
 16/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:COAST x Ruinart | October 30
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261030
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTSTAMP:20261030T164859Z
UID:d9efd3354efad47bf1d077dffeb2@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Experience an exceptional evening at COAST celebrating the art
 istry and elegance of Ruinart Champagne. Enjoy a thoughtfully curated culi
 nary experience paired with a selection of Ruinart’s distinguished spark
 ling Chardonnay expressions\, including Ruinart Blanc de Blancs\, Ruinart 
 Blanc Singulier Édition 19\, Ruinart Blanc Singulier Édition 18\, and Do
 m Ruinart Blanc de Blancs 2013. This exclusive evening invites guests to d
 iscover the distinctive character and craftsmanship of each cuvée\, paire
 d with an elevated menu designed to complement the wines and create a memo
 rable celebration of Champagne and cuisine. $375++ per person (wine pairin
 gs included) Menu Canapes | to be announced 1st Hamachi Tar Tar | Caviar a
 nd Cucumbers Ruinart Blanc de Blancs 2nd Lobster | Salsify\, Turnip Greens
 \, Lobster Jus Ruinart Blanc Singulier Édition 19 3rd Block Island Bluefi
 n Tuna | Parsnip\, Horseradish\, Golden Beets Ruinart Blanc Singulier Édi
 tion 18 4th Squab | Foie Gras\, White Port Reduction\, Pear\, Celery Root 
 Dom Ruinart Blanc de Blancs 2013 5th Black Currant "Kir Royale"\n\nSource:
  https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/coast-x-ruinart-%7c-october-30/112
 371/
LOCATION:Ocean House\, 1 Bluff Avenue\, Westerly\, 02891 Time: 5:30 PM to 
 10:30 PM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/coast-x-ruinart-%7c-october-30/
 112371/
END:VEVENT
