DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTSTAMP:20261030T164859Z
UID:139d2cdfb7b5e112d67ee2d7b6fe@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Join Mayor Maria Rivera and the Central Falls Parks &amp\; Rec
 reation Department on Friday\, October 30th from 6&#8211\;8 PM at Jenks Pa
 rk\, 602 Broad Street (playground side) for a night of Halloween fun for t
 he whole family! There will be music\, face painting\, costume contests\, 
 candy\, snacks and more! Put on your best costume and go celebrate Hallowe
 en!\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/central-falls-hallow
 een-night/112175/
